      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Apollo contact statuses → raw/ → account.yaml → Twenty, with a note per\nchange. Reply → Opportunity(NEW) + task. Opt-out → Apollo stop + DNC\n(the only authorized Apollo write) + store + Twenty. Audit: full Twenty\nexport → raw/twenty/, three-way count reconcile, UI-side drift → queue/.",
      "originalText": "Apollo contact statuses → raw/ → account.yaml → Twenty, with a note per change. Reply → Opportunity(NEW) + task. Opt-out → Apollo stop + DNC (the only authorized Apollo write) + store + Twenty. Audit: full Twenty export → raw/twenty/, three-way count reconcile, UI-side drift → queue/.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
