      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Human-only, never headless, never inferred from context. A human names\nthe batch → M4 unpauses exactly those contacts in Apollo → confirms\ncounts back → immediate M8 push (LIVE + go-live note). Everything\nupstream is autonomous; every enrollment sits paused until this.",
      "originalText": "Human-only, never headless, never inferred from context. A human names the batch → M4 unpauses exactly those contacts in Apollo → confirms counts back → immediate M8 push (LIVE + go-live note). Everything upstream is autonomous; every enrollment sits paused until this.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
